# Sunrise Gen AI homepage — locked

Do not revert this branch to Orbitron, neon, short films, or a React/Three hero.

## Stack

- Ship a static HTML one-pager. CSS + inline SVG only.
- Vanilla JS only to drive SVG stroke / dash-offset / path-draw animation.
- Forbidden: Three.js, WebGL, React, Next.js page, GSAP, Lottie, video, raster hero images, particle fields.
- Self-host IBM Plex Sans (OFL) from `/fonts`. No Orbitron. No Google Fonts CDN.

## Look

- Enterprise, royal, rich, neat, clean. Dawn/void field (`#000818`), not a black agency room.
- Palette: void `#000818`, sun `#D9661C`, hot `#FAC345`, teal `#06B6C3`. Rich, not carnival.
- Headline 36–40px. Body 16–18px. Not one giant word.
- Graphics: thin SVG flow / wireframe paths, nodes, arrows. Slow schematic motion. No 3D, orbit, HUD, blobs, photos, or painted lettering.

